        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF145 makes <code class=\"notranslate\">RTCEncodedAudioFrame</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">RTCEncodeVideoFrame</code> be serializeable and also adds copy constructors.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This creates a release note.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3510275107\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41508\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41508/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41508\">#41508</a></p>",
