        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR addresses the dev-docs needed requirements of <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1886894\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1886894</a> Clear sessionStorage in browsingData.remove() for parity with \"Clear Cookies and Site Data\". It includes:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>a release note</li>\n<li>update to the <code class=\"notranslate\">browsingData.removeLocalStorage</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">browsingData.remove</code>, and <code class=\"notranslate\">browsingData.DataTypeSet</code> documentation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related BCD changes in PR TBC.</p>",
