        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">part of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3499611477\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/project/issues/230\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openwebdocs/project/issues/230/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/project/issues/230\">openwebdocs/project#230</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">the conditional processing attribute link is added in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3525976962\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41576\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41576/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41576\">#41576</a></p>",
