        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51982229?u=49621ab3494f1edf90aaf2f15f62573031edcc1e&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Update the note on the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/container-type\" rel=\"nofollow\">container-type</a> page, where it says that applying <code class=\"notranslate\">container-type</code> automatically applies <code class=\"notranslate\">container: layout</code>, but this is no longer the case in recent browser versions. More information is available in the related issue.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Avoid reading outdated information.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #41375.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3478521416\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41375\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41375/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41375\">#41375</a></p>",
